s the highest quality professional legal counsel.','Experience &amp; Knowledge','Our attorneys are passionate about the law with decades of combined experience in complex litigation.','Drive &amp; Dedication','We are committed to delivering effective, efficient, and quality legal services because we care about every client and every case.','Courteous Service','Defense Lawyers, P.A. has an experienced and courteous staff to take you through the entire legal process.','Focus on Client Needs','We focus on the client&#039;s specific needs and acquiring the results that our clients want.','We Vigorously Advocate For Your Rights','To achieve successful results in complex litigation, you need more than just the facts on your side. You need experienced counsel.','Call 888.444.0253','Meet The Attorneys','Lee Stein, Esq.','Admitted in FL - 20+ Years Experience','Andre Sailers, Esq.','Admitted in GA - 32+ Years Experience','Wardell Huff, Esq.','Admitted in DC, NJ, NY, MD - 20+ Years','The attorneys at Defense Lawyers were exceptional in handling my business litigation case. Their attention to detail and aggressive representation resulted in a favorable settlement. I highly recommend their services to anyone facing legal challenges.','- John R., Business Owner','Our attorneys are passionate about the law. We are committed to delivering effective, efficient, and quality legal services because we care about every client and every case.','- Defense Lawyers, P.A.','Get Your Free Consultation Today','Don&#039;t face your legal challenges alone. Contact us now for expert guidance.','Office Location','Phone','Availability','Emergency Line','Office Hours:','Request Your Free Consultation','All information is confidential and protected by attorney-client privilege.','What type of legal issue? *','Bankruptcy','Landlord/Tenant Issues','Intellectual Property','Traffic Tickets','Other','This is urgent - I need immediate assistance','I understand that Defense Lawyers, P.A. has not yet agreed to represent me, and that submitting this form does not constitute a contract.','Request Free Consultation','&copy; 2025 MyDefenseLaw.','&times;','First Name *','Last Name *','Phone Number *','Email Address *','Briefly describe your situation...','Toggle navigation','Client testimonials','Testimonial 1 of 2','Testimonial 2 of 2','Previous testimonial','Next testimonial','Website language selector','Available languages') made by shutdown_action_hook, do_action('shutdown'), WP_Hook->do_action, WP_Hook->apply_filters, wp_ob_end_flush_all, ob_end_flush, TRP_Translation_Render->translate_page, TRP_Translation_Render->process_strings, TRP_Query->insert_strings, TRP_Query->original_strings_sync
